{"seq":3,"slug":"scene-management","title":"场景管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/interaction/scene-management","wordCount":1203,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"场景管理\">场景管理</h1><p>写到几十个图元时，「把所有绘制命令一股脑塞进 render 函数」还撑得住。可一旦图元上百上千、还要各自能移动、能嵌套、能被点击，这种平铺式代码会迅速失控：你既说不清谁压在谁上面，也无法只重画动的那个，更没法复用一组图形的变换。即时模式不替你管对象，所以你得自己在应用层建一套「对象的世界」——这就是场景管理。它把散落的绘制命令收拢成有结构、可遍历、可增量重绘的场景，是 Canvas 应用从玩具走向工程的分界线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>场景管理的核心是把「画什么」从「怎么画」里抽出来：用应用层的数据结构持有所有对象（位置、几何、样式、子对象），每帧遍历这棵结构生成绘制命令。这恰好补上了即时模式缺失的「保留」那一半——参见<a href=\"../foundations/drawing-model\">即时绘制模型</a>里即时与保留模式的对比。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;场景根节点 root&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;层 Layer: 背景&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;层 Layer: 内容&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;层 Layer: UI 覆盖&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;组 Group 应用变换&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;节点 圆&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G[&quot;节点 图片&quot;]&#10;  H[&quot;每帧 update&quot;] --&gt; I[&quot;遍历场景树&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; J[&quot;按层叠顺序绘制&quot;]&#10;  J --&gt; K{&quot;重绘策略&quot;}&#10;  K --&gt;|&quot;全量&quot;| L[&quot;clearRect 全屏 + 全画&quot;]&#10;  K --&gt;|&quot;分层&quot;| M[&quot;只重画变化的层&quot;]&#10;  K --&gt;|&quot;脏矩形&quot;| N[&quot;只清+画变化的区域&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"场景根节点 root\"] --&gt; B[\"层 Layer: 背景\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"层 Layer: 内容\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"层 Layer: UI 覆盖\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"组 Group 应用变换\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"节点 圆\"]\n  E --&gt; G[\"节点 图片\"]\n  H[\"每帧 update\"] --&gt; I[\"遍历场景树\"]\n  I --&gt; J[\"按层叠顺序绘制\"]\n  J --&gt; K{\"重绘策略\"}\n  K --&gt;|\"全量\"| L[\"clearRect 全屏 + 全画\"]\n  K --&gt;|\"分层\"| M[\"只重画变化的层\"]\n  K --&gt;|\"脏矩形\"| N[\"只清+画变化的区域\"]</pre><h2 id=\"场景图-对象的树\">场景图：对象的树</h2><p>场景图（scene graph）把对象组织成树：每个节点有自己的局部变换、几何与样式，子节点的变换叠加在父节点之上。绘制时做深度优先遍历，进入节点前 <code>save</code> 并施加其变换、退出后 <code>restore</code>，这样父节点平移整组子节点就一起平移——这正是<a href=\"../foundations/coordinate-transforms\">坐标系与变换</a>里变换累积与状态栈的直接应用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function drawNode(ctx, node) {&#10;  ctx.save();&#10;  ctx.translate(node.x, node.y);&#10;  if (node.rotation) ctx.rotate(node.rotation);&#10;  if (node.draw) node.draw(ctx); // 画自身&#10;  for (const child of node.children) drawNode(ctx, child); // 递归子节点&#10;  ctx.restore();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> drawNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">translate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.x, node.y);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node.rotation) ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rotate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node.rotation);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node.draw) node.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">draw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 画自身</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> child</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node.children) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drawNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, child); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 递归子节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">restore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>节点保存自身几何（常用 <a href=\"../rendering/paths-shapes\">Path2D</a>）后，命中检测就能遍历同一棵树逐节点测试——场景图于是同时服务于绘制和<a href=\"hit-detection\">命中检测</a>，两者共用一份对象数据，避免不一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重绘策略一-分层画布\">重绘策略一：分层画布</h2><p>每帧重画全部对象，在大部分内容静止时是巨大浪费。分层画布（layered canvas）把画面拆到多块叠放的 <code>&lt;canvas&gt;</code> 上：很少变的背景一层、频繁动的角色一层、几乎不变的 UI 一层。只有发生变化的层才重画，静止层原样保留。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 背景层只在初始化或尺寸变化时画一次&#10;// 动态层每帧 clearRect + 重画移动对象&#10;// UI 层仅在状态变化时重画\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 背景层只在初始化或尺寸变化时画一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 动态层每帧 clearRect + 重画移动对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// UI 层仅在状态变化时重画</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CSS 用 <code>position: absolute</code> 把多块画布精确叠放即可。分层的代价是更多内存和合成开销，层数要克制——通常 2–4 层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重绘策略二-脏矩形\">重绘策略二：脏矩形</h2><p>当变化集中在小区域（如只有一个对象移动），连整层重画都嫌多。脏矩形（dirty rectangle）只清除并重画发生变化的那一小块区域：记录对象移动前后的包围盒，把它们的并集标记为「脏」，本帧只 <code>clearRect</code> 并重画与脏区相交的对象。</p>\n<p>设画布面积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、脏区面积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，重绘成本近似与面积成正比，脏矩形把每帧绘制量从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(A_d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，对大画布、少量动对象的场景收益巨大。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function redrawDirty(ctx, dirtyRect, objects) {&#10;  ctx.save();&#10;  ctx.beginPath();&#10;  ctx.rect(dirtyRect.x, dirtyRect.y, dirtyRect.w, dirtyRect.h);&#10;  ctx.clip(); // 裁剪到脏区，绘制自动被限制&#10;  ctx.clearRect(dirtyRect.x, dirtyRect.y, dirtyRect.w, dirtyRect.h);&#10;  for (const o of objects) {&#10;    if (intersects(o.bounds, dirtyRect)) o.draw(ctx); // 只画相交对象&#10;  }&#10;  ctx.restore();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> redrawDirty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dirtyRect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">objects</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beginPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dirtyRect.x, dirtyRect.y, dirtyRect.w, dirtyRect.h);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 裁剪到脏区，绘制自动被限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clearRect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dirtyRect.x, dirtyRect.y, dirtyRect.w, dirtyRect.h);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> objects) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">intersects</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(o.bounds, dirtyRect)) o.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">draw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 只画相交对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">restore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>每帧绘制量</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>最适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量重绘</td>\n<td>全部对象</td>\n<td>最简单</td>\n<td>几乎全屏都在动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层画布</td>\n<td>变化的层</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>静/动内容可分层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脏矩形</td>\n<td>相交对象</td>\n<td>高（需追踪包围盒）</td>\n<td>大画布、少量局部变化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者可叠加：分层之上再对动态层用脏矩形。这些策略本质都是「只做必要的工作」，是<a href=\"../advanced/performance-optimization\">性能优化</a>的主干，那一篇会把它们放进系统化的优化方法论里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"视口剔除与空间索引\">视口剔除与空间索引</h2><p>对象远超屏幕容纳量时（如大地图、无限画布），还要避免绘制和检测「看不见的对象」。视口剔除（culling）每帧先用包围盒判断对象是否与可视区相交，不相交就跳过。当对象极多，逐个判断本身也成瓶颈，则引入空间索引（四叉树、网格分桶）把空间分区，只查询落在视口或鼠标附近分区的对象——这同样能加速<a href=\"hit-detection\">命中检测</a>的候选筛选。场景管理、命中、性能在这里彻底交汇：同一套空间结构既剔除绘制、又加速拾取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>场景管理在应用层补上即时模式缺的「保留」：用数据结构持有对象，每帧遍历生成绘制命令。</li>\n<li>场景图把对象组织成带局部变换的树，遍历时 save/施加变换/递归/restore，父变换自动叠加给子节点；同一棵树同时服务绘制与命中检测。</li>\n<li>分层画布把静/动内容拆到多块叠放画布，只重画变化的层。</li>\n<li>脏矩形只清并重画变化区域，把每帧绘制量从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(A_d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，适合大画布少量局部变化；三种重绘策略可叠加。</li>\n<li>对象极多时用视口剔除 + 空间索引（四叉树/网格）跳过不可见对象，同一结构也加速命中检测候选筛选。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"场景管理","id":"场景管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"场景图：对象的树","id":"场景图-对象的树"},{"level":2,"text":"重绘策略一：分层画布","id":"重绘策略一-分层画布"},{"level":2,"text":"重绘策略二：脏矩形","id":"重绘策略二-脏矩形"},{"level":2,"text":"视口剔除与空间索引","id":"视口剔除与空间索引"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"命中检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/interaction/hit-detection"},"next":{"title":"性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/advanced/performance-optimization"}}